# Keep line endings LF for files that break with CRLF. The repo is developed on
# Windows (autocrlf), but the Sailfish build engine's shell chokes on CRLF in the
# spec, and rpmlint errors on CRLF inside the packaged QML/JSON/SVG. Scoped to the
# Sailfish app and shell scripts so the rest of the tree is not renormalized here.
*.sh          text eol=lf
*.spec        text eol=lf
*.pro         text eol=lf
*.desktop     text eol=lf
sailfish/**/*.qml   text eol=lf
sailfish/**/*.json  text eol=lf
sailfish/**/*.svg   text eol=lf
